  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7685aae6-6e51-5d3f-a36c-b7dc18df8d95" activityNameId="46d0d76c-d73d-52bf-aa28-5fed7b6c6ece" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rare earth concentrate, 70% REO, from bastnasite, at beneficiation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rare earth concentrate, 70% REO, from bastnasite, at beneficiation
In- and outputs are calculated from bastnasite ore composition mined in China. Infrastructure and land use approximated with iron ore mining. Some inputs of auxiliary materials are calculated according to stoechiometry. Rough estimation for energy consumption, wastes and emissions.;
UUID: 1cf5cf73-cce7-31d0-b5ca-1fdb6dfe2fa3
The process includes material and energy input, emissions and land use for the mining and concentration of a bastnasite ore with a rare earth oxide concentration of 6%. Transport and infrastructure are estimated.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mineral concentration by froth flotation to rare earth concentrate product with 70% rare earth oxide (REO). Leaching of concentrate with HCL included but no calcination.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1cf5cf73-cce7-31d0-b5ca-1fdb6dfe2fa3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
